Art: NOT included, NOT covered by this license.

The game is drawn with the premium "Sprout Lands" asset packs (Sprites and UI)
by Cup Nooble (https://cupnooble.itch.io/). Their license allows using them in
games but forbids redistributing the packs, even modified, so they are not in
this repository and this MIT license does not apply to them. Buy the packs and
install them with tools/install_assets.py (see README.md, "Art").

The pictures that are in this repository (the enemy sheets drawn for this game,
the title pictures and other screenshots of the game, the sprout-pixel font made
by tools/build_font.py) are under the MIT license above; screenshots show the
Sprout Lands art as it appears in the game.
